  "path": "/how-to-support",
  "http_status": 200,
  "title": "Support | Dreamfarmcommons",
  "meta_description": null,
  "og_image": null,
  "plain_text": "You can support our continued creative offerings here: venmo @dream-farm-commonsfor more ways to support\nDream Farm Commons see below...Past fundraisersCanned goodsbrought to Dream Farm Commons on Friday November 21 went to our 15th St Neighbors, who have been facing food insecurity,all deeply appreciated.Connie Zheng has generously made this limited edition print available as a fundraiser for Dream Farm Commons. Price $100\n​\nTo purchase a print please email us at: info@dreamfarmcommons.com\n​​Connie Zheng\nA very abridged history of plant migrations, mixed media on Yupo paper\n2020\nA very abridged history of plant migrations is a mixed-media cartographic drawing (available as a downloadable poster or high-quality print for sale) that attempts to trace the origins — and migratory movements — of important food staples in the US over the past 500 years, highlighting the ways in which the violent history of colonization and globalization are embodied in the humble diasporic seed, and the ways in which agricultural and geopoliticall histories have always been intertwined. One Time\n​\nIf you'd like to make a one time donation, you can do so below via PayPal.\nThank you for your contribution!Monthly on Patreon\n​​\nPlease donate $5, $10, $25 or $35 per month\nYour dollars will contribute to keeping the small but mighty Dream Farm Commons producing culture, visuality, and discourse in Oakland Tax Deductible\n​\nTo make tax deductible donations to Dream Farm Commons visit please contact us at info@dreamfarmcommons.com",
  "rich_text": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "comp-mi6kjmjn",
      "text": "You can support our continued creative offerings here: venmo @dream-farm-commons",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:29px;\"><a href=\"https://account.venmo.com/u/dream-farm-commons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">You can support our continued creative offerings here:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#3D9BE9;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">venmo @dream-farm-commons</span></span></a></h2>",
      "sha256": "f450eb55cd310ac0330f1d47cdd3ef112d218ee85ef3266176a17950585b700c"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "comp-k3oy5n4b",
      "text": "for more ways to support\nDream Farm Commons see below...",
      "html": "<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:38px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:38px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">for more ways to support<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nDream Farm Commons see below...</span></span></span></span></h1>",
      "sha256": "a7dd8f9ba0741d582a677225216c682e73bae5ba3d43d989b7ac974c17aec9f3"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "comp-mo2507jr",
      "text": "Past fundraisers",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:29px;\"><a href=\"https://account.venmo.com/u/dream-farm-commons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Past fundraisers</a></h2>",
      "sha256": "ef5f721b58e737df630b0c9a7617a0ed54b06eca6388349fc729707f2cb0cfc9"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "comp-mi6t3k2p",
      "text": "Canned goodsbrought to Dream Farm Commons on Friday November 21 went to our 15th St Neighbors, who have been facing food insecurity,all deeply appreciated.",
      "html": "<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:dinneuzeitgroteskltw01-_812426,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Canned goodsbrought to Dream Farm Commons on Friday November 21 went&nbsp; to our 15th St Neighbors, who have been facing food insecurity,all deeply appreciated.</span></span></span></h1>",
      "sha256": "18e97c0875a7fb275f8521a427d8d2dc4f4b81214027b891c6b820185ca3e80f"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "comp-kendrhuw",
      "text": "Connie Zheng has generously made this limited edition print available as a fundraiser for Dream Farm Commons. Price $100\n​\nTo purchase a print please email us at: info@dreamfarmcommons.com\n​​",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Connie Zheng has generously made this limited edition print available as a fundraiser for Dream Farm Commons. Price $100</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To purchase a print please email us at: <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"mailto:info@dreamfarmcommons.com\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">info@dreamfarmcommons.com</a></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​​</span></span></p>",
      "sha256": "f9ea493d01ee8d1d52b8120b54ac0f472dcd22601fb0350c3c71e5851d5d2612"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "comp-kendhebq",
      "text": "Connie Zheng\nA very abridged history of plant migrations, mixed media on Yupo paper\n2020\nA very abridged history of plant migrations is a mixed-media cartographic drawing (available as a downloadable poster or high-quality print for sale) that attempts to trace the origins — and migratory movements — of important food staples in the US over the past 500 years, highlighting the ways in which the violent history of colonization and globalization are embodied in the humble diasporic seed, and the ways in which agricultural and geopoliticall histories have always been intertwined.",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">Connie Zheng</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">A very abridged history of plant migrations, mixed media on Yupo paper</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">2020</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">A very abridged history of plant migrations is a mixed-media cartographic drawing (available as a downloadable poster or high-quality print for sale) that attempts to trace the origins — and migratory movements — of important food staples in the US over the past 500 years, highlighting the ways in which the violent history of colonization and globalization are embodied in the humble diasporic seed, and the ways in which agricultural and geopoliticall histories have always been intertwined.</p>",
      "sha256": "24b9ec20424095838795b4f40b75832ecee0df05ecf514e054ecea1e9196e109"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "comp-k3oy5li2",
      "text": "One Time\n​\nIf you'd like to make a one time donation, you can do so below via PayPal.\nThank you for your contribution!",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:22px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"display:none;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">One Time</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:11px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">If you'd like to make a one time donation, you can do so below via PayPal. </span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Thank you for your contribution!</span></span></span></p>",
      "sha256": "b45accacbb8119f23c0d789cabd70fa2cf0e0e42e09786bffe09ff0c17ecdcef"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "comp-k6vi6qrg",
      "text": "Monthly on Patreon\n​​\nPlease donate $5, $10, $25 or $35 per month\nYour dollars will contribute to keeping the small but mighty Dream Farm Commons producing culture, visuality, and discourse in Oakland",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:22px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/dreamfarmcommons?fan_landing=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Monthly on Patreon</span></span></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:11px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Please donate&nbsp; $5, $10, $25 or $35 per month&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Your dollars will contribute to keeping the small but mighty Dream Farm Commons producing culture, visuality, and discourse in Oakland</span></p>",
      "sha256": "775f342e3264be6e92ea2a5ac28ddfdf50307252660d1b9fa077e97225933df4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "comp-k6vi6h11",
      "text": "Tax Deductible\n​\nTo make tax deductible donations to Dream Farm Commons visit please contact us at info@dreamfarmcommons.com",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:22px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"display:none;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"https://proartsgallery.org/fiscal-sponsorship/fiscal-clients/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Tax Deductible</span></a></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:11px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To make tax deductible donations to Dream Farm Commons visit please contact us at <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"mailto:info@dreamfarmcommons.com\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">info@dreamfarmcommons.com</a></span></span></span></p>",
      "sha256": "4669a1fee43687c6a7b6e852040437431504523eae0242274d6a8754f1b2d122"
    }
